  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for MailKit — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for SmtpClient.SendAsync and any MailKit SMTP operation. Includes a built-in MailKitTransientErrors predicate covering socket failures, I/O errors, lost connections, and operation timeouts. Essential for any app that sends transactional email via SMTP.",
